[[Asterius the Mighty]] is a [[Minotaur]] [[boss]] that appears in [[Varajar Fells]]. He and his group make a wide [[patrol]] circuit around the southwestern part of the [[zone]], circling all around [[Olafstead]] before heading back.

==Locations==
* [[Far Shiverpeaks]]
** {{NPC location|Varajar Fells}}

==Skills==
14 [[Mysticism]], 16 [[Wind Prayers]] (20 Mysticism in [[Hard mode]])
* {{skill icon|Harrier's Grasp}}
* {{skill icon|Harrier's Haste}}
* {{skill icon|Mystic Vigor}}
* {{skill icon|Reaper's Sweep}}  ([[elite]])
* {{skill icon|Victorious Sweep}}
* {{skill icon|Zealous Renewal}}
* {{monster skill icon|Berserk}}

==Items dropped==
* [[Asterius' Scythe]] ([[unique]])
* [[Berserker Horn]]

==Notes==
* In [[normal mode]], it takes him 8-10 minutes to patrol his route. In hard mode, he will run his route in 2 minutes.

==Trivia==
* Asterius (more correctly known as, [[w:Asterion|Asterion]]) is the name of the Greek king of Crete, father of [[w:Minos|Minos]] (who is better known as the creator of the infamous [[w:Labyrinth|Labyrinth]] with a minotaur at its center).
